TRIPLE BASELINE FORMULAS

def calculate_triple_baseline(market_cap, current_supply):
    """Triple baseline: current / post-unlock / annual"""
    
    # 1. Current Baseline
    current_floor = market_cap / (current_supply * 0.99)
    
    # 2. Post-Unlock Baseline (+10M T)
    post_unlock_supply = current_supply + 10_000_000
    post_unlock_floor = market_cap / (post_unlock_supply * 0.99)
    
    # 3. Annual Baseline (~12 unlocks)
    annual_supply = current_supply + (10_000_000 * 12)
    annual_floor = market_cap / (annual_supply * 0.99)
    
    return {current_floor, post_unlock_floor, annual_floor}

Mathematical Formulas:

Current_Floor = MC ÷ (Current_Supply × 0.99)
Post_Unlock_Floor = MC ÷ ((Current_Supply + 10M) × 0.99)
Annual_Floor = MC ÷ ((Current_Supply + ...M) × 0.99)
